+
+- `ready` -> `Ready`
+- `ok` -> `Ready`
+- `blocked` -> `Needs attention`
+- `failed` -> `Needs attention`
+- `missing-config` -> `Not configured yet`
+- `planned-target` -> `Planned`
+- `awaiting-bootstrap` -> `Waiting`
+- `blocked_by_prior_stage` -> `Waiting on earlier step`
+
